tional Storage Mechanism for inspection at https://data.fca.org.uk/#/nsm/nationalstoragemechanism."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Board notes that whilst Resolutions 11 and 12 (political donations and allotment of shares) were passed with the requisite majority, for the purposes of the UK Corporate Governance Code (the \"Code\"), more than 20% of the votes cast, were against these resolutions."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Board is aware that certain shareholders apply their own voting policies in relation to these resolutions, rather than concerns relating to the Board, the Company's governance arrangements or the performance of the Group."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Board values the views of all shareholders and in accordance with Provision 4 of the Code, will continue to engage with shareholders and provide a further update within six months of the AGM."]},{"type":"p","children":["Laura Walker"]},{"type":"p","children":["Company Secretary"]},{"type":"p","children":["Dialight plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel: +44 (0) 203 058 3525"]},{"type":"p","children":["LEI: 2138001AD31KKD29Z495"]},{"type":"p","children":["About Dialight:"]},{"type":"p","children":["Dialight (LSE: DIA.L) is a global leader in sustainable LED Lighting for industrial applications and Opto-Electronics Components. Dialight's LED products are providing the next generation of lighting solutions that deliver reduced energy consumption and create a safer working environment. Our products are specifically designed to provide superior operational performance, reliability, and durability, reducing energy consumption and ongoing maintenance, and achieving a rapid return on investment.  The Company is headquartered in the UK with operations in Australia, Dubai, Malaysia, Mexico, Singapore and the USA.  www.dialight.com."]},"This information is provided by RNS, the news service of the London Stock Exchange. RNS is approved by the Financial Conduct Authority to act as a Primary Information Provider